{"seq":1,"slug":"status-conditions","title":"Status Conditions 设计协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-operator-patterns/advanced-patterns/status-conditions","wordCount":1136,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"status-conditions-设计协议\">Status Conditions 设计协议</h1><p>Status Conditions 是 Kubernetes 资源向外部观察者（用户、监控系统、上层控制器）传达自身健康状态和进度信息的标准协议。在 Operator 开发中，精心设计的 Condition 体系是用户判断&quot;我的资源是否正常&quot;的唯一窗口——设计不当会导致状态不可读、告警噪音过大、排障效率低下。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Condition 结构</strong>：Type（肯定语义 PascalCase）+ Status（True/False/Unknown 三态）+ Reason（机器可读）+ Message（人可读）</li>\n<li><strong>ObservedGeneration</strong>：标记 Condition 是基于哪个 spec generation 计算的，判断 Condition 是否过时</li>\n<li><strong>顶层聚合</strong>：Ready/Available 作为总体状态指示器，细粒度 Condition 解释具体原因</li>\n<li><strong>原子更新</strong>：一次 Status Update 包含所有 Condition 的最新值，避免中间态可见</li>\n<li><strong>Condition 与 Event 协作</strong>：Condition 是持久状态（当前是什么），Event 是瞬时通知（发生了什么）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"condition-的结构与语义\">Condition 的结构与语义</h2><p>Kubernetes 定义了标准的 Condition 结构（<code>metav1.Condition</code>），所有自定义 Condition 都应遵循这一格式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"type Condition struct {&#10;    Type               string                 // 条件类型（如 &quot;Ready&quot;, &quot;Degraded&quot;）&#10;    Status             ConditionStatus        // &quot;True&quot;, &quot;False&quot;, &quot;Unknown&quot;&#10;    ObservedGeneration int64                  // 观测到的 spec generation&#10;    LastTransitionTime metav1.Time            // Status 最后变更时间&#10;    Reason             string                 // 机器可读的原因码（CamelCase）&#10;    Message            string                 // 人可读的详细描述&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Condition</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Type               </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                 // 条件类型（如 \"Ready\", \"Degraded\"）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Status             </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ConditionStatus</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // \"True\", \"False\", \"Unknown\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ObservedGeneration </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int64</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                  // 观测到的 spec generation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    LastTransitionTime </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">metav1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Time</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            // Status 最后变更时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Reason             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                 // 机器可读的原因码（CamelCase）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Message            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                 // 人可读的详细描述</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>规范</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Type</td>\n<td>PascalCase，肯定语义（<code>Ready</code> 非 <code>NotReady</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Status</td>\n<td>三态：<code>True</code>（满足）、<code>False</code>（不满足）、<code>Unknown</code>（无法判断）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reason</td>\n<td>CamelCase 单词组合，唯一标识原因（如 <code>InsufficientReplicas</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Message</td>\n<td>面向人的自然语言，含具体数值和建议行动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ObservedGeneration</td>\n<td>必须设置为处理该状态时观测到的 <code>metadata.generation</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[Reconcile 开始] --&gt; B[读取 CR Spec + 子资源状态]&#10;    B --&gt; C[计算各 Condition 新值]&#10;    C --&gt; D{Condition 是否变更?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[更新 LastTransitionTime + 写 Status]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[只更新 ObservedGeneration]&#10;    E --&gt; G[发送 Event 通知重大变更]&#10;    F --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n    A[Reconcile 开始] --&gt; B[读取 CR Spec + 子资源状态]\n    B --&gt; C[计算各 Condition 新值]\n    C --&gt; D{Condition 是否变更?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[更新 LastTransitionTime + 写 Status]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[只更新 ObservedGeneration]\n    E --&gt; G[发送 Event 通知重大变更]\n    F --&gt; G</pre><h2 id=\"condition-类型设计原则\">Condition 类型设计原则</h2><p><strong>顶层聚合 Condition</strong>：设计一个 <code>Ready</code>（或 <code>Available</code>）作为顶层条件，表示资源整体是否可用。这是 kubectl、监控系统和依赖控制器最先查看的字段。</p>\n<p><strong>细粒度诊断 Condition</strong>：在 <code>Ready</code> 之下，设计若干细粒度条件解释&quot;为什么 Ready 是 False&quot;。这为排障提供精确的切入点。</p>\n<p>典型的 Database Operator Condition 体系：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Condition 类型</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>Ready=False 的原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Ready</code></td>\n<td>数据库整体可用，接受读写</td>\n<td>任何子条件 False</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>StatefulSetReady</code></td>\n<td>StatefulSet 所有 Pod 就绪</td>\n<td>Pod 启动失败、镜像拉取失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ConfigApplied</code></td>\n<td>配置已同步到实例</td>\n<td>ConfigMap 更新未传播</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>BackupReady</code></td>\n<td>备份基础设施就绪</td>\n<td>存储桶不可达、凭证失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Degraded</code></td>\n<td>运行中但能力降级（如只读、单副本）</td>\n<td>副本数不足最小要求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Progressing</code></td>\n<td>正在执行长时操作（升级、扩容）</td>\n<td>正常过渡，非错误状态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>设计规则</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>使用肯定语义</strong>：<code>Ready</code>（而非 <code>NotReady</code>）、<code>Available</code>（而非 <code>Unavailable</code>）——True 表示好消息</li>\n<li><strong>Reason 唯一且稳定</strong>：Reason 是监控告警的匹配键，一旦定义不应随意变更</li>\n<li><strong>Message 具体可行</strong>：不写&quot;something went wrong&quot;，而写&quot;StatefulSet my-db has 1/3 ready replicas; Pod my-db-2 is in CrashLoopBackOff due to OOM&quot;</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"observedgeneration-的正确使用\">ObservedGeneration 的正确使用</h2><p><code>ObservedGeneration</code> 是 Condition 可信度的关键指标——它告诉观察者&quot;这个 Condition 是基于哪个版本的 spec 计算的&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 每次更新 Condition 时设置 ObservedGeneration&#10;func setCondition(db *databasev1.Database, condType string, status metav1.ConditionStatus, reason, message string) {&#10;    meta.SetStatusCondition(&amp;db.Status.Conditions, metav1.Condition{&#10;        Type:               condType,&#10;        Status:             status,&#10;        ObservedGeneration: db.Generation,  // 关键：设置为当前 spec generation&#10;        Reason:             reason,&#10;        Message:            message,&#10;        LastTransitionTime: metav1.Now(),&#10;    })&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 每次更新 Condition 时设置 ObservedGeneration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> setCondition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">db</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">databasev1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Database</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">condType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">status</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> metav1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ConditionStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reason</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    meta.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SetStatusCondition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db.Status.Conditions, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">metav1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Condition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Type:               condType,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Status:             status,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ObservedGeneration: db.Generation,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 关键：设置为当前 spec generation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Reason:             reason,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Message:            message,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        LastTransitionTime: metav1.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>当 <code>condition.ObservedGeneration &lt; resource.Generation</code> 时，说明该 Condition 是基于旧版本 spec 计算的——它可能已经过时。监控系统和 CI/CD 工具应将此视为&quot;状态未知&quot;而非&quot;状态健康&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"condition-更新的原子性\">Condition 更新的原子性</h2><p>Status 更新必须是原子的——一次 Update 调用包含所有 Condition 的最新值。不要在一次调谐中多次更新 Status（每次只更新一个 Condition），这会导致：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>多次 API 调用增加延迟和冲突概率</li>\n<li>中间状态对外可见，产生误导性告警</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 正确模式：收集所有 Condition 后一次性写入&#10;func (r *DatabaseReconciler) Reconcile(ctx context.Context, req ctrl.Request) (ctrl.Result, error) {&#10;    var db databasev1.Database&#10;    if err := r.Get(ctx, req.NamespacedName, &amp;db); err != nil {&#10;        return ctrl.Result{}, client.IgnoreNotFound(err)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 计算所有子条件&#10;    stsReady := r.checkStatefulSetReady(ctx, &amp;db)&#10;    configApplied := r.checkConfigApplied(ctx, &amp;db)&#10;    backupReady := r.checkBackupReady(ctx, &amp;db)&#10;&#10;    // 聚合顶层 Ready&#10;    ready := stsReady &amp;&amp; configApplied &amp;&amp; backupReady&#10;&#10;    // 一次性设置所有 Condition&#10;    setCondition(&amp;db, &quot;StatefulSetReady&quot;, boolToStatus(stsReady), ...)&#10;    setCondition(&amp;db, &quot;ConfigApplied&quot;, boolToStatus(configApplied), ...)&#10;    setCondition(&amp;db, &quot;BackupReady&quot;, boolToStatus(backupReady), ...)&#10;    setCondition(&amp;db, &quot;Ready&quot;, boolToStatus(ready), ...)&#10;&#10;    // 单次 Status Update&#10;    return ctrl.Result{}, r.Status().Update(ctx, &amp;db)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 正确模式：收集所有 Condition 后一次性写入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">DatabaseReconciler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Reconcile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ctrl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ctrl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">databasev1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Database</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, req.NamespacedName, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db); err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ctrl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}, client.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">IgnoreNotFound</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(err)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 计算所有子条件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    stsReady </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">checkStatefulSetReady</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    configApplied </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">checkConfigApplied</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    backupReady </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">checkBackupReady</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 聚合顶层 Ready</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ready </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stsReady </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> configApplied </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> backupReady</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 一次性设置所有 Condition</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    setCondition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"StatefulSetReady\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">boolToStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(stsReady), </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    setCondition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ConfigApplied\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">boolToStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(configApplied), </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    setCondition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BackupReady\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">boolToStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(backupReady), </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    setCondition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Ready\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">boolToStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ready), </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 单次 Status Update</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ctrl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}, r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"condition-与-event-的协作\">Condition 与 Event 的协作</h2><p>Condition 是<strong>持久状态</strong>（当前是什么），Event 是<strong>瞬时通知</strong>（发生了什么）。两者协作提供完整的可观测性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Condition</th>\n<th>Event</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>持久性</td>\n<td>存在于 Status 中，持续可查</td>\n<td>短暂存在（默认 TTL 1 小时）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用途</td>\n<td>当前状态判断</td>\n<td>历史时间线追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>粒度</td>\n<td>粗粒度（类型级别）</td>\n<td>细粒度（每次操作）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>触发告警</td>\n<td>适合</td>\n<td>不适合（太多噪音）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>最佳实践</strong>：在 Condition 发生重大状态转换（True→False 或 False→True）时同步发送 Event。不要为每次调谐都发 Event——这会产生大量噪音。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"if previousReady &amp;&amp; !currentReady {&#10;    r.Recorder.Event(&amp;db, corev1.EventTypeWarning, &quot;BecameUnready&quot;,&#10;        fmt.Sprintf(&quot;Database %s is no longer ready: %s&quot;, db.Name, reason))&#10;}&#10;if !previousReady &amp;&amp; currentReady {&#10;    r.Recorder.Event(&amp;db, corev1.EventTypeNormal, &quot;BecameReady&quot;,&#10;        fmt.Sprintf(&quot;Database %s is now ready with %d replicas&quot;, db.Name, db.Spec.Replicas))&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> previousReady </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">currentReady {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    r.Recorder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db, corev1.EventTypeWarning, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BecameUnready\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        fmt.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Sprintf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Database </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> is no longer ready: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, db.Name, reason))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">previousReady </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currentReady {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    r.Recorder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db, corev1.EventTypeNormal, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BecameReady\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        fmt.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Sprintf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Database </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> is now ready with </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> replicas\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, db.Name, db.Spec.Replicas))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"printcolumn-与-kubectl-集成\">PrintColumn 与 kubectl 集成</h2><p>通过 <code>+kubebuilder:printcolumn</code> marker 将关键 Condition 信息暴露到 <code>kubectl get</code> 的输出中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// +kubebuilder:printcolumn:name=&quot;Ready&quot;,type=string,JSONPath=`.status.conditions[?(@.type==&quot;Ready&quot;)].status`&#10;// +kubebuilder:printcolumn:name=&quot;Reason&quot;,type=string,JSONPath=`.status.conditions[?(@.type==&quot;Ready&quot;)].reason`,priority=1&#10;// +kubebuilder:printcolumn:name=&quot;Age&quot;,type=date,JSONPath=`.metadata.creationTimestamp`\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// +kubebuilder:printcolumn:name=\"Ready\",type=string,JSONPath=`.status.conditions[?(@.type==\"Ready\")].status`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// +kubebuilder:printcolumn:name=\"Reason\",type=string,JSONPath=`.status.conditions[?(@.type==\"Ready\")].reason`,priority=1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// +kubebuilder:printcolumn:name=\"Age\",type=date,JSONPath=`.metadata.creationTimestamp`</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这使得用户无需 <code>kubectl describe</code> 或 <code>jq</code> 就能快速判断资源状态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"NAME       READY   AGE&#10;my-db      True    5d&#10;test-db    False   2h\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>NAME       READY   AGE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>my-db      True    5d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>test-db    False   2h</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Status Conditions 是 Operator 与用户之间的通信协议。设计良好的 Condition 体系使用肯定语义的类型名、三态 Status、稳定的 Reason 码和具体可行动的 Message；通过 ObservedGeneration 标记时效性；一次 Status Update 原子写入所有 Condition；在重大状态转换时配合 Event 提供时间线追踪；通过 PrintColumn 暴露到 kubectl 输出。避免设计过多的 Condition 类型（5-8 个为佳），避免为每次调谐都更新 LastTransitionTime。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相关文档\">相关文档</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"finalizers-ownership\">Finalizers 与所有权管理</a>——Status Condition 在资源清理过程中的角色</li>\n<li><a href=\"../operations/operator-observability\">Operator 可观测性</a>——Condition 如何驱动 Prometheus 指标和告警</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Status Conditions 设计协议","id":"status-conditions-设计协议"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Condition 的结构与语义","id":"condition-的结构与语义"},{"level":2,"text":"Condition 类型设计原则","id":"condition-类型设计原则"},{"level":2,"text":"ObservedGeneration 的正确使用","id":"observedgeneration-的正确使用"},{"level":2,"text":"Condition 更新的原子性","id":"condition-更新的原子性"},{"level":2,"text":"Condition 与 Event 的协作","id":"condition-与-event-的协作"},{"level":2,"text":"PrintColumn 与 kubectl 集成","id":"printcolumn-与-kubectl-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关文档","id":"相关文档"}],"prev":{"title":"Webhook 准入控制开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-operator-patterns/development/webhooks-validation"},"next":{"title":"Finalizers 与所有权管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-operator-patterns/advanced-patterns/finalizers-ownership"}}